Ubuntu cloud image

This package contains an unmodified Ubuntu cloud image downloaded from
https://cloud-images.ubuntu.com/. The image is an aggregate of separately
licensed software packages. It is not covered by a single license.

- The license of each package in the image is in
  /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright inside the image.
- The list of packages and versions is in the <image>.manifest file
  published by Canonical next to the image. This package installs it
  next to the image.
